---

vpnbox uses public data from:
- VPN Gate (https://vpngate.net) — the academic VPN relay experiment of the
  University of Tsukuba. VPN Gate data and service are governed by their own
  terms; public VPN relay operators are volunteers.
- OpenStreetMap Nominatim (https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org) — geocoding,
  ODbL.
- ip-api.com — IP geolocation (free tier).
- OpenVPN (https://openvpn.net) — GPL, invoked as a separate program.
